; A song imported from a VGM or an NSF comes in frames, not beats. Edit > Tap
; Tempo writes it again on a beat of your own, for as long as that score is
; open: play it and tap at least four beats on the button or a MIDI key, the
; first one a bar's first. The song's onsets then hold the taps to its tempo;
; ×2 and ÷2 and the BPM box correct it by hand, a note within Snap of the
; grid lands on it, and Bar lines fold the repeats. Each change writes the
; score again, one undo; As imported goes back.
